### SkillSphere Nexus - Milestone 4 (Career & Analytics) REST API Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/api/career

### 1. Create a Career Plan (Calculates promotion score & eligibility auto-set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "employeeName": "John Smith",
  "currentRole": "Developer",
  "targetRole": "Tech Lead",
  "progress": 67,
  "mentor": "Jane Doe",
  "skillGaps": "Angular +3",
  "trainingPlan": "Angular Advanced Bootcamp"
}


### 2. Create another Career Plan (High score -> Promotion Eligible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "employeeName": "Sarah Jenkins",
  "currentRole": "Senior Engineer",
  "targetRole": "Principal Architect",
  "progress": 90,
  "mentor": "Robert Chen",
  "skillGaps": "",
  "trainingPlan": "Executive Leadership Program"
}


### 3. Get All Career Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans


### 4. Get Career Plan by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111


### 5. Get Career Plans by Employee ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/employee/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111


### 6. Create Internal Job Posting
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Java Developer",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "requiredSkills": "Java, Spring Boot, Microservices",
  "minimumExperience": 3
}


### 7. Create another Job Posting
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lead Angular Architect",
  "department": "Frontend Platform",
  "requiredSkills": "Angular 20, RxJS, TypeScript",
  "minimumExperience": 5
}


### 8. Get All Active Internal Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs/active


### 9. Get Executive Analytics Dashboard Data
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics
